# Swimming with the arms (Rerac-vr's traversal.rs, tracked_swim): Ratchet put in water treads it; palms
# turned broad to the push stroke backward and he swims where the head looks; edge-on they do nothing;
# both hands pushing the water up dive.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3300 shot treading
# Broad palms, pushing back: the hand's right is along the stroke.
3340 hand_yaw 90
3400 rh_z 0.1
3401 lh_z 0.1
3404 rh_z 0.2
3405 lh_z 0.2
3408 rh_z 0.3
3409 lh_z 0.3
3412 rh_z 0.4
3413 lh_z 0.4
3500 rh_z 0.0
3501 lh_z 0.0
3540 rh_z 0.1
3541 lh_z 0.1
3544 rh_z 0.2
3545 lh_z 0.2
3548 rh_z 0.3
3549 lh_z 0.3
3552 rh_z 0.4
3553 lh_z 0.4
3640 shot stroked
# Edge-on: the same push carries nothing.
3660 hand_yaw 0
3700 rh_z 0.0
3701 lh_z 0.0
3704 rh_z 0.2
3705 lh_z 0.2
3708 rh_z 0.4
3709 lh_z 0.4
3800 shot edge-on
# Both palms flat, pushed up: the dive.
3820 hand_roll 90
3830 rh_y -0.4
3831 lh_y -0.4
3860 rh_y -0.3
3861 lh_y -0.3
3864 rh_y -0.2
3865 lh_y -0.2
3868 rh_y -0.1
3869 lh_y -0.1
4000 shot dived
4100 quit 0
